/T (An AprilTag is a type of black-and-white visual marker, similar to a QR code, used in robotics and computer vision for localization, navigation, and object identification. By detecting an AprilTag with a camera, a computer system can quickly determine the tag's exact position and orientation in 3D space relative to the camera, providing precise, real-time data for tasks like guiding robots to specific locations or calibrating cameras.)
/E (An AprilTag is a type of black-and-white visual marker, similar to a QR code, used in robotics and computer vision for localization, navigation, and object identification. By detecting an AprilTag with a camera, a computer system can quickly determine the tag's exact position and orientation in 3D space relative to the camera, providing precise, real-time data for tasks like guiding robots to specific locations or calibrating cameras.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
