/S /H5
/P 340 0 R
/T (5.We discovered the root cause was an incorrect AprilTag library setup. This is a powerful lesson: sometimes the problem isn't in your logic, but in an external dependency or a foundational configuration detail. By adding AprilTagLibrary aprilTagLibrary = AprilTagGameDatabase.getCurrentGameTagLibrary\(\);, we correctly initialized the library for our specific application.)
/E (5.We discovered the root cause was an incorrect AprilTag library setup. This is a powerful lesson: sometimes the problem isn't in your logic, but in an external dependency or a foundational configuration detail. By adding AprilTagLibrary aprilTagLibrary = AprilTagGameDatabase.getCurrentGameTagLibrary\(\);, we correctly initialized the library for our specific application.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
